## Decisions Made
* **Project Direction:** Agreed to build a web-based phishing awareness game titled **"Everyday Dilemma"** aimed at educating students on cybersecurity threats.
* **Game Mechanics:** Decided that the game will use a scenario-based narrative approach where users make choices and see immediate consequences.
* **Development Stack:** Agreed to use standard web technologies for early prototyping, with GitHub serving as the central version control and collaboration platform.
* **Role Confirmation:** Formally approved the team roles listed in the attendance section above.

